      <language id="en"><![CDATA[Help Desk and Self Service]]></language>
    </name>
    <markdowncontent><![CDATA[A chat that answers questions, qualifies visitors and captures leads around the clock. Tickets get answered fast with suggested replies. Not implemented yet.]]></markdowncontent>
  </data>
